  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Market System Development Training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In line with CAFOD&apos;s global strategy of &apos;Our Common Home&apos; call to adopt an integral Ecology approach to our programming, the CAFOD Africa Programme team has agreed to adopt a Capacity Building programme for staff and partners on Market System Development(MSD) and Value Chain Analysis (VCA) Approach and models.

The Market Systems training is expected to equip staff and partners with an understanding of the Market System Approaches and Value Chains in order to strengthen our resilience work. The training will introduce MSD principles and strategies and compare this to conventional value chain development and other approaches</narrative>
  </description>
